<title>POLAND: Rolimpex to trade live in blocks of 250.</title>
<headline>Rolimpex to trade live in blocks of 250.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Polish food trader Rolimpex SA will be traded in blocks of 250 in Warsaw bourse continuous trade from September 30, the bourse said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Rolimpex currently trades live in blocks of 50.</p>
<p>The main market stock undergoes a one-to-five split in September.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
